OL,3,GNEWSAStormont to lose #117m due to
OL,4,Adefence spending - O'Dowd
OL,5,
OL,6,FStormont is to receive less
OL,7,Finfrastructure funding than expected
OL,8,Ffrom the UK government as a result of
OL,9,Fmoney being reallocated into defence
OL,10,Fspending, the finance minister has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FJohn O'Dowd said that over the next
OL,14,Ffour years the Northern Ireland
OL,15,FExecutive would get #117m less than
OL,16,Fpreviously planned.
OL,18,F"The reason we lost that money is
OL,19,Fbecause it is going to military spend,"
OL,20,Fhe said.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
